{% if language == 'zh' %}
连续性、消息量、回合组织与词汇重叠是不同维度，不合成为感情分数。本稿描述一个双人档案；线下交流、已读时刻和具体生活背景大多不可见。后续可由双方共同标注部分样本，核对话题与情绪解释。

时间戳按配置时区处理。非系统消息间隔超过阈值开始新对话，发送者切换或新对话开始新回合。聊天日按配置时刻划分。通话仅按有效会话标识去重；没有标识的提示单独统计，缺失时长不补零，冲突时长不任意选取。

内容词由 jieba 分词，去除小型示例停用词。固定合并词表后，每月每人无放回等量抽取消息，报告中位数和中间95\%抽样范围。该范围不是因果置信区间。八类虚词使用小型自定义词典，未经量表验证。词语对比采用带信息先验的加权对数优势比作相对排序。

探索性情绪默认关闭；开启后以示例词典评分，未命中保持缺失，日期整组重抽样估计回复间隔中位数差。没有人工标注的准确率，也没有调用在线模型。语音和通话时长来自输入元数据，不进行转写或录音播放。
{% else %}
Continuity, volume, turns and lexical overlap describe separate dimensions, without a combined affection score. This single-pair archive omits much offline communication, read timing and life context. Joint annotation of selected samples could test future interpretations.

Timestamps use the configured timezone. A participant-message gap above the threshold starts a conversation; a sender change or new conversation starts a turn. The configured boundary defines chat days. Calls are grouped only by usable session identifiers. Unidentified notices remain separate; missing or conflicting durations are not arbitrarily filled.

Content words use jieba and a small example stoplist. Equal message samples are drawn without replacement within month and person using a fixed pooled vocabulary. Medians and central 95\% sampling ranges are sensitivity summaries, not causal confidence intervals. Eight-category function-word matching is an unvalidated example. Informative-prior log odds rank corpus-relative word contrasts.

Exploratory affect is disabled by default. If enabled, example-lexicon scores retain missing matches and dates are resampled as clusters for reply-gap median differences. No human-validated accuracy or online model is claimed. Voice and call durations are metadata; no transcription or playback is performed.
{% endif %}
